        title: "Senior Multiplatform Frontend Developer at Swiss1Mobile / Collana",
        description:
            `Modernizing legacy mobile and backend applications with Flutter, Jetpack Compose, Firebase, Node.js, TypeScript, Ktor, RabbitMQ, and REST APIs.
            Working across SQL and NoSQL systems while improving delivery workflows, production stability, and maintainability.
            Collaborating with product and engineering teams to turn complex requirements into reliable mobile releases.`,
    },
    {
        date: "2021 - 2024",
        title: "Senior Full Stack Engineer at Sime Telecom",
        description:
            `Built and maintained production mobile applications with Flutter, Jetpack Compose, Kotlin Multiplatform, and SwiftUI.
            Designed scalable architectures, integrated Firebase and cloud-backed features, and helped recover and stabilize complex mobile projects.
            Supported team delivery through mentoring, ownership, client communication, and pragmatic technical leadership.`,
    },
    {
        date: "2022 - 2023",
        title: "Cybersecurity Specialization",
        description: "Completed at IES Pere Maria Orts in Benidorm.",
